{"version":2,"sourceHash":"34490a1621a056bc7c4d9c4f625bd71b787a7711fc83a5790846b911dc731be0","locale":"zh-TW","id":"ep-52","no":"EP.52","tag":"第52話 · 櫻花河畔的約定","title":"櫻花河畔的約定","rev":2,"branch":"reality","beats":[{"id":"ep-52:1","s":"n","t":"週四。一下課，Yeoni就推著自行車往河邊去。手機地圖上標著和Byeongha約好的長椅。離約定還有半小時。","bg":"river","bgm":"flowingLight","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"think"},"c":null,"r":null,"sfx":"water","scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-52:2","s":"n","t":"在第一座橋旁走錯了路，Yeoni調轉車頭往河邊下去。明明還沒遲到，卻不停看時間。"},{"id":"ep-52:3","s":"yeon","t":"半小時明明夠用，怎麼每看一眼，時間都往前跑了。","x":"disappoint"},{"id":"ep-52:4","s":"sys","t":"[ 應用訊息 · Kang Saebyeok：確認長椅位置了嗎？花落了，約定也不會落。慢慢來，諮詢費以後再說 ]","im":true,"sfx":"chime","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 시스템 메시지"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-52:5","s":"yeon","t":"幫忙傳號碼是很感謝，但為什麼要諮詢費？走錯路能退款嗎？","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-52:6","s":"n","t":"嘴上這麼說，Yeoni還是踩著踏板。今天她故意穿了不成對的襪子，左腳黃色，右腳條紋。"},{"id":"ep-52:7","s":"yeon","t":"他肯定又先看襪子。聽見那句嘮叨，我應該也能像平時一樣說話了。","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-52:8","s":"n","t":"早上挑襪子時，Yeoni反覆練習見面的第一句話。「我想你了」卻始終說不出口。她希望不成對的襪子能替她說。"},{"id":"ep-52:9","s":"sys","t":"[ 應用訊息 · Moka：今天見面吧？說不出話就放我的饒舌，氣氛可不保證 ]","sfx":"chime"},{"id":"ep-52:10","s":"yeon","t":"這哪是打氣，分明是搗亂。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-52:11","s":"n","t":"河風捲走花瓣，Yeoni放慢了踩踏。比起迷路，她更擔心一看見他的臉就哭出來。"},{"id":"ep-52:12","s":"yeon","t":"花落了，以後再來就好。今天沒說出口的話，下次也能說。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-52:13","s":"n","t":"Yeoni握緊車把。掌心正中微微發暖，是那片金曾停留的位置。"},{"id":"ep-52:14","s":"n","t":"四點前，她到了約好的長椅。停自行車時手一滑，車倒向草地。Yeoni慌忙低頭翻包，掩飾自己的緊張。","bg":"bench","bgm":"teaHouse","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"disappoint"},"c":null,"r":null,"sfx":"thud","scene":{"background":"bench","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: bench","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"bench 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-52:15","s":"yeon","t":"路明明找對了，怎麼故障的是我。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-52:16","s":"n","t":"筆記本頂端寫著四點、河邊長椅。下面Park Byeongha旁，她又小小地補了一個Neo。看見熟悉的名字，呼吸慢慢平穩下來。"},{"id":"ep-52:17","s":"yeon","t":"先叫他的名字就好了，像以前一樣。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-52:18","s":"n","t":"正要合上本子，一片花瓣落在紙頁間。Yeoni沒有拂去，就讓它夾在裡面。"},{"id":"ep-52:19","s":"n","t":"這時，長椅另一端傳來噴嚏聲。Yeoni轉過頭。"},{"id":"ep-52:20","s":"n","t":"一把白傘倚著長椅，旁邊坐著個男人，膝上攤著書，腳邊蜷著一隻流浪貓。","im":true,"sfx":"whoosh","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"bench","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: bench","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"bench 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-52:21","s":"neo","t":"啊，抱歉。我對貓過敏。","x":"hneutral","r":{"who":"neo","x":"hneutral"}},{"id":"ep-52:22","s":"yeon","t":"那怎麼不趕走牠？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-52:23","s":"neo","t":"牠先坐在這裡的。是牠的位置。","x":"hcalm"},{"id":"ep-52:24","s":"n","t":"男人有一綹頭髮是白的，不像染的，倒像天生如此。眼神冷淡，嗓音低沉。"},{"id":"ep-52:25","s":"n","t":"Yeoni屏住呼吸。那是她在船上第一次見到的人類模樣的他。男人也看向Yeoni，按著書頁的指尖停住了。"},{"id":"ep-52:26","s":"neo","t":"妳的腳踏車倒了。","x":"hneutral"},{"id":"ep-52:27","s":"yeon","t":"啊，嗯，我知道。故意的。","x":"shock"},{"id":"ep-52:28","s":"neo","t":"頭一次見有人故意讓車倒下。","x":"hsoft"},{"id":"ep-52:29","s":"n","t":"男人垂眼繼續看書，隨後又停住。視線落在Yeoni的腳踝，黃色襪子與條紋襪子之間。","bg":"bench","shot":"close","sfx":"none","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"shy"},"r":{"who":"neo","x":"hneutral"},"scene":{"background":"bench","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: bench","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"bench 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-52:30","s":"neo","t":"那個，妳的襪子不成對。","x":"hpoint","im":true,"shot":"impact","sfx":"heartbeat","scene":{"background":"bench","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: bench","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"bench 배경에서 진행되는 neo의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-52:31","s":"n","t":"Yeoni沒能答話，緊緊咬住嘴唇，眼睛發熱。男人慌忙合上書。"},{"id":"ep-52:32","s":"neo","t":"……本來想先說我很想你。結果先看見了襪子。","x":"hache"},{"id":"ep-52:33","s":"yeon","t":"沒關係，以前天天聽。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-52:34","s":"neo","t":"我去過妳家門口，也在學校前等過。早該去找Saebyeok的。","x":"hneutral"},{"id":"ep-52:35","s":"yeon","t":"我也一直在你可能出現的地方找。明明現在又能聽見你嘮叨，我還自己練習了半天。","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-52:36","s":"n","t":"Byeongha抿緊嘴唇，一副笑著笑著就要哭出來的表情。看著他的臉，Yeoni也忍不住笑了。"},{"id":"ep-52:37","s":"neo","t":"那個人現在就在妳面前。妳可以罵他。","x":"hsoft"},{"id":"ep-52:38","s":"yeon","t":"這次號碼存好了。別再一個人到處找，給我打電話。我也會的。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-52:39","s":"neo","t":"看來他讓妳等了很久。","x":"hneutral"},{"id":"ep-52:40","s":"yeon","t":"可不是。等我這種話還沒說，先看了襪子。以後也一直這樣嗎？","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-52:41","s":"neo","t":"那確實太過分了。我沒法辯解。","x":"hache"},{"id":"ep-52:42","s":"n","t":"Byeongha有些難為情地揉了揉太陽穴。看著那個熟悉的動作，Yeoni終於放鬆了肩膀。"},{"id":"ep-52:43","s":"n","t":"Byeongha扶起自行車交給Yeoni，她把車把的一側留給他。兩人配合著步子走向河邊，不必再匆忙尋找彼此了。","bg":"cherryDay","bgm":"neo2","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"happy"},"c":null,"r":{"who":"neo","x":"hcalm"},"fx":"stars","sfx":"sparkle","scene":{"background":"cherryDay","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: cherryDay","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"stars","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"cherryDay 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-52:44","s":"n","t":"櫻花道沿河延伸很遠。花瓣隨風飛起，落在兩人肩上，是最後的幾片花瓣了。"},{"id":"ep-52:45","s":"neo","t":"能說件奇怪的事嗎？最近，我總做同一個夢。","x":"hspeak"},{"id":"ep-52:46","s":"yeon","t":"什麼夢？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-52:47","s":"neo","t":"夢見和一個拿黃傘的人走在這條路上。有時還有一隻豬，戴著粉紅色的花。","x":"hsoft"},{"id":"ep-52:48","s":"yeon","t":"豬？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-52:49","s":"neo","t":"以為是叫我買樂透的夢，就買了三次，全部沒中。","x":"hcalm"},{"id":"ep-52:50","s":"yeon","t":"那不是樂透夢，真的。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-52:51","s":"neo","t":"那是什麼夢？妳會解夢？","x":"hspeak"},{"id":"ep-52:52","s":"yeon","t":"聽說夢見豬，就會遇上貴人。我剛編的。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-52:53","s":"n","t":"Byeongha這才笑出了聲，Yeoni也止不住笑。一片花瓣落在他那縷白髮上。"},{"id":"ep-52:54","s":"yeon","t":"我們重新自我介紹一次吧？這次不再隱瞞名字。","x":"serious","bg":"cherryDay","shot":"close","sfx":"none","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"serious"},"r":{"who":"neo","x":"hneutral"},"scene":{"background":"cherryDay","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: cherryDay","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"cherryDay 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-52:55","s":"neo","t":"Park Byeongha。妳呢？","x":"hneutral"},{"id":"ep-52:56","s":"n","t":"Park Byeongha。Yeoni在心裡輕輕念了一遍。第一次在戀人牌上讀到的名字，那個據說一叫出口，他就會消失的名字。"},{"id":"ep-52:57","s":"n","t":"現在叫出名字，他也不會消失了。Yeoni寫下的卡牌已把名字和記憶歸還主人。她想在現實中也親口確認這一點。"},{"id":"ep-52:58","s":"yeon","t":"不過，還有我給你起的名字呢。","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-52:59","s":"n","t":"Yeoni搖了搖頭。她要叫的，是另一個名字，是她自己起的，是押上一星評價起的名字。"},{"id":"ep-52:60","s":"yeon","t":"我叫Yeoni。還有，能拜託你一件事嗎？","x":"gentle","im":true,"shot":"close","sfx":"heartbeat","scene":{"background":"cherryDay","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: cherryDay","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"cherryDay 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-52:61","s":"neo","t":"什麼事？","x":"hneutral"},{"id":"ep-52:62","s":"yeon","t":"接下來我要叫我給你起的名字。這次要馬上回答我。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-52:63","s":"yeon","t":"Neo。","x":"cry","bg":"cherryDay","bgm":"starsName","shot":"impact","fx":"reveal","sfx":"bell","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"cry"},"r":{"who":"neo","x":"hneutral"},"scene":{"background":"cherryDay","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: cherryDay","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"reveal","camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"cherryDay 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-52:64","s":"n","t":"風停了。正落下的花瓣彷彿在半空稍作停留。Park Byeongha停下腳步。","im":true,"shot":"impact","sfx":"chime","scene":{"background":"cherryDay","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: cherryDay","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"cherryDay 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-52:65","s":"neo","t":"啊。","x":"hache"},{"id":"ep-52:66","s":"n","t":"他撫著額頭，短暫地閉上眼，強忍淚水的呼吸變得悠長。記憶中的聲音，終於從眼前的Yeoni口中響起。"},{"id":"ep-52:67","s":"n","t":"下雨的車站，翻過來的雨傘，床尾屬於貓的位置，食傷之島的太陽，金庫裡的龍蛋，淹在水中的書架，空亡裡的白光。"},{"id":"ep-52:68","s":"n","t":"還有，在河上的船裡，第一次握住他人類手掌的Yeoni。那時落在肩上的溫度。","im":true,"fx":"thread","sfx":"sparkle","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"cherryDay","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: cherryDay","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"thread","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"cherryDay 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-52:69","s":"neo","t":"Yeoni。","x":"hsoft"},{"id":"ep-52:70","s":"yeon","t":"嗯，是我，穿錯襪子的那個。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-52:71","s":"neo","t":"星級想好了？不是說定好了就告訴我嗎？","x":"hcalm"},{"id":"ep-52:72","s":"n","t":"玩笑般的客套話結束了。直率，帶點傲氣，尾音卻莫名溫柔。那是她一路都想聽見的語氣。"},{"id":"ep-52:73","s":"yeon","t":"五星。本來想因為遲到扣一星，忍住了。不過評價會寫很長。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-52:74","s":"neo","t":"挺大方。","x":"hsmile"},{"id":"ep-52:75","s":"n","t":"Yeoni抓著他的襯衫哭了。Byeongha猶豫片刻，伸手環住她的背。這次，身體沒有一處變模糊。","bg":"cherryDay","shot":"wide","sfx":"none","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"happy"},"r":{"who":"neo","x":"hsmile"},"scene":{"background":"cherryDay","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: cherryDay","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"cherryDay 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-52:76","s":"neo","t":"這次手不透明了。這樣抱著妳……沒關係吧？","x":"hcalm"},{"id":"ep-52:77","s":"yeon","t":"頭，摸頭就好。這個你會吧。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-52:78","s":"neo","t":"還有，Yeoni，襪子怎麼又不成對？","x":"harms"},{"id":"ep-52:79","s":"yeon","t":"這是測試。你通過了。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-52:80","s":"n","t":"跟在腳邊的流浪貓喵了一聲。Park Byeongha打了個噴嚏，Yeoni笑出了聲。"},{"id":"ep-52:81","s":"neo","t":"偏偏這過敏沒變。回來時就不能順便治一下嗎？得給客服打個電話。","x":"hneutral"},{"id":"ep-52:82","s":"yeon","t":"給客服申訴吧。排隊只有一個人，很快就能接通。","x":"happy"},{"id":"ep-52:83","s":"yeon","t":"回來以後，記憶也一直都在吧？作為Byeongha生活的日子，還有作為Neo的日子，都在吧？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-52:84","s":"neo","t":"都記得。上班、交房租的Byeongha，陪在妳身邊的Neo，還有船上妳握住的那隻手。","x":"hspeak"},{"id":"ep-52:85","s":"neo","t":"奇怪，一點也不會混亂。大概因為，兩個都是我。","x":"hsoft"},{"id":"ep-52:86","s":"yeon","t":"那怎麼叫你？Byeongha？Neo？","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-52:87","s":"neo","t":"用妳給我起的名字吧，Yeongnyangi。在別人面前叫Byeongha。要是在公司叫Yeongnyangi，就得解釋半天。","x":"hcalm"},{"id":"ep-52:88","s":"yeon","t":"本來沒打算去你公司。現在有了。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-52:89","s":"n","t":"Byeongha笑了，一邊嘴角先翹起來，笑得有點笨拙。Yeoni覺得，這個表情自己不會再忘了。","im":true,"fx":"heart","sfx":"chime","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"cherryDay","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: cherryDay","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"heart","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"cherryDay 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-52:90","s":"n","t":"夕陽傾向河面，花瓣漂在水上，緩緩流去。兩人並肩倚著河畔欄杆。","bg":"river","bgm":"firstLight","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"happy"},"c":null,"r":{"who":"neo","x":"hsmile"},"sfx":"water","scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-52:91","s":"neo","t":"夢裡走過這條路。一個普通的春天，和妳。","x":"hspeak"},{"id":"ep-52:92","s":"yeon","t":"夢裡我們做了什麼？不會在吵架吧？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-52:93","s":"neo","t":"什麼也沒做，只是走著。那樣最好。吵架，醒了才吵。","x":"hsoft"},{"id":"ep-52:94","s":"yeon","t":"那就約好，每年春天都來這裡走走。花落之前，什麼也不做。","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-52:95","s":"neo","t":"約定就是拿來遵守的。要是下雨，傘由妳撐，黃色那把。","x":"hcalm"},{"id":"ep-52:96","s":"sys","t":"[ 應用程式通知 · 徐寒雨：看海定在五月第二個星期六。可以再帶一位，別帶掉毛的那位 ]","im":true,"sfx":"chime","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 시스템 메시지"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-52:97","s":"neo","t":"早就不掉毛了，怎麼還說這事？","x":"hpoint"},{"id":"ep-52:98","s":"yeon","t":"你還打噴嚏啊。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-52:99","s":"n","t":"Yeoni回覆：加一位。人類。不掉毛。負責檢查襪子。"},{"id":"ep-52:100","s":"sys","t":"[ 應用程式通知 · Kang Saebyeok：找到了吧。今日運勢算準了，現收取諮詢費。另外，請問他的出生時辰 ]","sfx":"chime"},{"id":"ep-52:101","s":"neo","t":"這人怎麼還問出生時辰？","x":"hpoint"},{"id":"ep-52:102","s":"yeon","t":"想看看咱倆合不合。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-52:103","s":"neo","t":"我們有乙庚合就夠了。不是一起走到這裡了嗎？","x":"hcalm"},{"id":"ep-52:104","s":"yeon","t":"可還是會好奇呀，能打幾分。","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-52:105","s":"neo","t":"不是滿分，就給那算命的一星。","x":"hsmile"},{"id":"ep-52:106","s":"n","t":"Yeoni笑著把手機放回口袋，牽起Park Byeongha的手。人的手比想像中大，也比想像中涼一點。"},{"id":"ep-52:107","s":"yeon","t":"手好涼。因為是庚金嗎？","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-52:108","s":"neo","t":"是妳的手暖，因為是乙木。","x":"hsoft"},{"id":"ep-52:109","s":"n","t":"兩人牽著手沿河走去。流浪貓遠遠跟在後面，Park Byeongha又打了個噴嚏。最後一片花瓣，順著河水流遠。"}]}
